units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic
newton on
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
timestep 0.001

lattice fcc 3.52
region box block 0 1 0 1 0 1 units lattice
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
replicate 10 10 10
mass 1 58.6934

pair_style eam
pair_coeff 1 1 /scratch/gilbreth/holbrooe/LAMMPS-AST/publication/potentials/prompt2.potential

thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step temp press pe ke etotal vol
reset_timestep 0
velocity all create 600.0 12345 mom yes rot no dist gaussian

fix 1 all npt temp 300.0 2500.0 0.1 iso 1.01325 1.01325 1.0
run 10
unfix 1